---
/**
 * Every component in every state, with Almagest content. Rendered once per
 * theme by gallery.astro. Dev only.
 */
---
<div class="al-stack al-stack--lg g-body">

  <section class="al-stack" aria-labelledby={`g-type-${Astro.props.id}`}>
    <h2 class="g-h" id={`g-type-${Astro.props.id}`}>Type</h2>
    <h1>Retry policy for the scheduler</h1>
    <h2>Claims and where they come from</h2>
    <h3>Backoff</h3>
    <p>Body text is 15px Geist with a 1.6 line height. The scheduler retries a failed job after a fixed backoff, and a <a href="#">link in running text</a> is ink with a quiet underline. Identifiers use mono: <code>ingest/q3-board-deck-abcdef1</code>. Press <kbd class="al-kbd">j</kbd> then <kbd class="al-kbd">k</kbd> to move.</p>
    <p class="al-text-secondary">Secondary text, for explanations and lede lines.</p>
    <p class="al-text-tertiary">Tertiary text, for timestamps and counts only.</p>
    <p><a class="al-link-arrow" href="#">Open the review inbox</a> &nbsp; <a class="al-link-arrow al-link-arrow--back" href="#">All pages</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">App bar</h2>
    <div class="al-appbar g-static"><div class="al-appbar__inner">
      <a class="al-appbar__brand" href="#">Almagest<span class="al-appbar__brand-sub">Review</span></a>
      <nav class="al-appbar__nav" aria-label="Example"><a class="al-appbar__link" href="#" aria-current="page">To review <span class="al-appbar__count">3</span></a><a class="al-appbar__link" href="#">Re-check</a><a class="al-appbar__link" href="#">Canonical <span class="al-appbar__count">1</span></a></nav>
      <div class="al-appbar__end"><span class="al-appbar__name">Ada Reviewer</span><button class="al-btn al-btn--sm" type="button">Sign out</button></div>
    </div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Buttons</h2>
    <div class="al-cluster">
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--primary" type="button">Approve all</button>
      <button class="al-btn" type="button">Ask for changes</button>
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--quiet" type="button">Dismiss</button>
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--danger" type="button">Turn down</button>
      <a class="al-btn" href="#">As a link</a>
    </div>
    <div class="al-cluster">
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--primary al-btn--sm" type="button">Small</button>
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--sm" type="button">Small</button>
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--lg" type="button">Large</button>
      <button class="al-btn al-btn--primary" type="button" disabled>Disabled</button>
      <button class="al-btn" type="button" disabled>Disabled</button>
      <a class="al-btn" href="#" aria-disabled="true">Disabled link</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Badges, tiers, chips</h2>
    <div class="al-cluster">
      <span class="al-tier al-tier--canonical">canonical</span>
      <span class="al-tier al-tier--curated">curated</span>
      <span class="al-tier al-tier--evidence">evidence</span>
      <span class="al-badge">claim</span>
      <span class="al-badge al-badge--quiet">stub</span>
    </div>
    <div class="al-cluster">
      <span class="al-chip">Waiting for review</span>
      <span class="al-chip al-chip--success">Ready</span>
      <span class="al-chip al-chip--warning">2 questions for you</span>
      <span class="al-chip al-chip--danger">Taken out</span>
      <span class="al-chip al-chip--info">Frequently read page</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Callouts</h2>
    <div class="al-callout al-callout--info"><span class="al-callout__title">Note</span>New material shows up here when the agent finishes reading a source.</div>
    <div class="al-callout al-callout--success"><span class="al-callout__title">Added</span>This is now part of the knowledge base.</div>
    <div class="al-callout al-callout--warning"><span class="al-callout__title">Check this</span>This page cites no sources. Treat its contents as unverified.</div>
    <div class="al-callout al-callout--danger"><span class="al-callout__title">Broken links</span>These wikilinks point at pages that don't exist: [[retry-budget]].</div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Card, panel, list rows</h2>
    <div class="al-card al-card--flush">
      <div class="al-card__head"><span class="al-card__title">Job scheduler</span><span class="al-tier al-tier--curated">curated</span><span class="al-chip">Changed</span></div>
      <div class="al-card__body">
        <div class="al-claim al-claim--change">
          <div class="al-claim__op">Updated fact</div>
          <div class="al-claim__was">Was: <del>The scheduler retries on a fixed 30-second backoff.</del></div>
          <p class="al-claim__text">The scheduler retries on an exponential backoff starting at 30 seconds.</p>
          <div class="al-claim__source">Source: <strong>Alpha System Overview</strong>, page 3 · 2026-10-02</div>
          <blockquote class="al-quote">Failed jobs are retried with exponential backoff, starting at 30 seconds and doubling up to 10 minutes.</blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="al-claim al-claim--add">
          <div class="al-claim__op">New fact</div>
          <p class="al-claim__text">Jobs are retried at most five times.</p>
          <div class="al-claim__missing">No source given for this.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="al-claim al-claim--remove">
          <div class="al-claim__op">Removed fact</div>
          <p class="al-claim__text">Retries never exceed 30 seconds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="al-card al-card--interactive" href="#"><strong>New material from “Q3 board deck”</strong><div class="al-text-secondary">3 pages change, 12 facts, 2 questions</div></a>
    <div class="al-panel">A panel groups quiet information on the secondary surface, with no border.</div>
    <ul class="al-list">
      <li class="al-list__item"><a class="al-row" href="#"><span class="al-row__title">Job scheduler</span><span class="al-row__summary">The scheduler decides when a queued job runs and how often it retries.</span><span class="al-row__meta"><span class="al-tier al-tier--curated">curated</span></span></a></li>
      <li class="al-list__item"><a class="al-row" href="#"><span class="al-row__title">Retry budget</span><span class="al-row__summary">A stub page waiting for a source.</span><span class="al-row__meta"><span class="al-badge al-badge--quiet">stub</span><span class="al-tier al-tier--evidence">evidence</span></span></a></li>
      <li class="al-list__item"><a class="al-row" href="#"><span class="al-row__title">Approval policy</span><span class="al-row__summary">Who may approve what, and when two approvals are needed.</span><span class="al-row__meta"><span class="al-tier al-tier--canonical">canonical</span></span></a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Table</h2>
    <div class="al-table-wrap">
      <table class="al-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Page</th><th>Last checked</th><th class="al-table__num">Overdue</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>Job scheduler</strong><div class="al-text-tertiary">job-scheduler</div></td><td>2026-07-01</td><td class="al-table__num">140 days</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Approval policy</strong><div class="al-text-tertiary">approval-policy</div></td><td>never</td><td class="al-table__num">12 days</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Form controls</h2>
    <div class="al-field"><label class="al-label" for={`g-a-${Astro.props.id}`}>Search</label><input class="al-input" id={`g-a-${Astro.props.id}`} type="search" placeholder="Search by source or page" /></div>
    <div class="al-field"><label class="al-label" for={`g-b-${Astro.props.id}`}>Reason</label><input class="al-input" id={`g-b-${Astro.props.id}`} type="text" value="Too vague" aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby={`g-be-${Astro.props.id}`} /><span class="al-error" id={`g-be-${Astro.props.id}`}>Give a reason of at least ten characters.</span></div>
    <div class="al-field"><label class="al-label" for={`g-c-${Astro.props.id}`}>Tier</label><select class="al-select" id={`g-c-${Astro.props.id}`}><option>Evidence</option><option>Curated</option><option>Canonical</option></select><span class="al-hint">Canonical pages are locked.</span></div>
    <div class="al-field"><label class="al-label" for={`g-d-${Astro.props.id}`}>Tell the agent what to change</label><textarea class="al-textarea" id={`g-d-${Astro.props.id}`}></textarea></div>
    <div class="al-field"><label class="al-label" for={`g-e-${Astro.props.id}`}>Disabled</label><input class="al-input" id={`g-e-${Astro.props.id}`} disabled value="Not editable" /></div>
    <div class="al-stack al-stack--sm">
      <label class="al-check"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Notify me by email</label>
      <label class="al-check"><input type="checkbox" /> Include done proposals</label>
      <label class="al-check"><input type="radio" name={`g-r-${Astro.props.id}`} checked /> Evidence</label>
      <label class="al-check"><input type="radio" name={`g-r-${Astro.props.id}`} /> Curated</label>
      <label class="al-check"><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Disabled option</label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Tabs, segmented, breadcrumb, pagination, key hints</h2>
    <nav class="al-tabs" aria-label="Example tabs"><a class="al-tabs__tab" href="#" aria-current="page">Overview</a><a class="al-tabs__tab" href="#">Sources</a><a class="al-tabs__tab" href="#">History</a></nav>
    <div><div class="al-segmented"><a class="al-segmented__item" href="#" aria-current="true">To review</a><a class="al-segmented__item" href="#">Done</a><a class="al-segmented__item" href="#">All</a></div></div>
    <ol class="al-breadcrumb"><li><a href="#">All pages</a></li><li><a href="#">Systems</a></li><li aria-current="page">Job scheduler</li></ol>
    <ul class="al-pagination"><li><a class="al-pagination__link" href="#" aria-disabled="true">Previous</a></li><li><a class="al-pagination__link" href="#" aria-current="page">1</a></li><li><a class="al-pagination__link" href="#">2</a></li><li><a class="al-pagination__link" href="#">3</a></li><li class="al-pagination__gap">…</li><li><a class="al-pagination__link" href="#">9</a></li><li><a class="al-pagination__link" href="#">Next</a></li></ul>
    <p>Shortcuts: <kbd class="al-kbd">⌘</kbd> <kbd class="al-kbd">K</kbd> search, <kbd class="al-kbd">a</kbd> approve, <kbd class="al-kbd">Esc</kbd> close.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Definition list, code, empty, skeleton</h2>
    <dl class="al-dl al-dl--mono"><dt>Proposal</dt><dd>prp_01HZX9K</dd><dt>Branch</dt><dd>ingest/q3-board-deck-abcdef1</dd><dt>Reviewed version</dt><dd>3f9a1c7d2e40</dd></dl>
    <pre class="al-pre"><code>node tools/audit.mjs --check-index</code></pre>
    <pre class="al-pre al-pre--wrap al-pre--preview">## Retries

The scheduler retries on an exponential backoff. [source: alpha-pdf, p.3]</pre>
    <div class="al-empty"><p class="al-empty__title">Nothing to review</p><p>New material shows up here when the agent finishes reading a source.</p><a class="al-btn al-btn--sm" href="#">Open the pages list</a></div>
    <div class="al-stack al-stack--sm" aria-hidden="true"><span class="al-skeleton al-skeleton--line"></span><span class="al-skeleton al-skeleton--line"></span><span class="al-skeleton al-skeleton--line al-skeleton--short"></span><span class="al-skeleton al-skeleton--block"></span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Decision</h2>
    <div class="al-decision">
      <h3>These two facts disagree</h3>
      <p>The knowledge base and the new material give different backoffs.</p>
      <div class="al-decision__vs">
        <div class="al-decision__side"><div class="al-text-tertiary">The knowledge base says</div>Fixed 30-second backoff.<div class="al-claim__source">Source: Alpha System Overview, page 3</div></div>
        <div class="al-decision__side"><div class="al-text-tertiary">The new material says</div>Exponential backoff from 30 seconds.<div class="al-claim__source">Source: Q3 board deck, page 12</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="al-decision__options"><button class="al-btn al-btn--block" type="button">Keep what the knowledge base says</button><button class="al-btn al-btn--block" type="button">Use the new material</button></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Diff, unified</h2>
    <div class="al-diff" role="table" aria-label="Unified diff">
      <div class="al-diff__hunk">@@ -12,5 +12,6 @@ ## Retries</div>
      <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--ctx"><span class="al-diff__ln">12</span><span class="al-diff__ln">12</span><span class="al-diff__code">The scheduler runs queued jobs in order.</span></div>
      <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--del"><span class="al-diff__ln">13</span><span class="al-diff__ln"></span><span class="al-diff__code">A failed job is retried on a <del class="al-diff__rem">fixed 30-second</del> backoff. [source: alpha-pdf, p.3]</span></div>
      <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--add"><span class="al-diff__ln"></span><span class="al-diff__ln">13</span><span class="al-diff__code">A failed job is retried on an <ins class="al-diff__ins">exponential</ins> backoff. [source: q3-deck, p.12]</span></div>
      <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--add"><span class="al-diff__ln"></span><span class="al-diff__ln">14</span><span class="al-diff__code">Jobs are retried at most five times. [source: unknown]</span></div>
      <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--ctx"><span class="al-diff__ln">14</span><span class="al-diff__ln">15</span><span class="al-diff__code">Retries are logged in the activity feed.</span></div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="g-h">Diff, split</h2>
    <div class="al-diff al-diff--split" role="table" aria-label="Split diff">
      <div class="al-diff__hunk">@@ -12,5 +12,6 @@ ## Retries</div>
      <div class="al-diff__row">
        <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--ctx"><span class="al-diff__ln">12</span><span class="al-diff__code">The scheduler runs queued jobs in order.</span></div>
        <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--ctx"><span class="al-diff__ln">12</span><span class="al-diff__code">The scheduler runs queued jobs in order.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="al-diff__row">
        <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--del"><span class="al-diff__ln">13</span><span class="al-diff__code">A failed job is retried on a <del class="al-diff__rem">fixed 30-second</del> backoff.</span></div>
        <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--add"><span class="al-diff__ln">13</span><span class="al-diff__code">A failed job is retried on an <ins class="al-diff__ins">exponential</ins> backoff.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="al-diff__row">
        <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--empty"><span class="al-diff__ln"></span><span class="al-diff__code"></span></div>
        <div class="al-diff__line al-diff__line--add"><span class="al-diff__ln">14</span><span class="al-diff__code">Jobs are retried at most five times.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Review: contents rail, page header, compare, marked words</h2>
    <div class="g-rail">
      <nav class="al-rail" aria-label="Contents of this proposal (example)">
        <h2>First</h2>
        <ul class="al-rail__list" role="list"><li><a class="al-rail__link al-rail__link--ask" href="#"><span class="al-rail__state"><svg class="al-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5.5"/><path d="M8 5v3.4M8 10.6v.1"/></svg></span><span class="al-rail__name">1 question to answer first</span></a></li></ul>
        <h2>Pages</h2>
        <p class="al-rail__progress"><progress class="al-progress" max="3" value="1">1 of 3</progress><span>1 of 3 pages accepted</span></p>
        <ul class="al-rail__list" role="list">
          <li><a class="al-rail__link" href="#" aria-current="location"><span class="al-rail__state al-rail__state--accepted"><svg class="al-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5.5"/><path d="M5.5 8.2l1.7 1.7 3.3-3.6"/></svg><span class="al-visually-hidden">Accepted: </span></span><span class="al-rail__name">Job scheduler</span><span class="al-rail__meta"><span class="al-rail__kind">New</span><span class="al-tier al-tier--curated">Curated</span><span class="al-delta"><span class="al-delta__add">+12</span> <span class="al-delta__chg">~1</span> <span class="al-delta__del">-0</span></span></span></a></li>
          <li><a class="al-rail__link" href="#"><span class="al-rail__state"><svg class="al-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5.5"/></svg><span class="al-visually-hidden">Not accepted yet: </span></span><span class="al-rail__name">Retry budget</span><span class="al-rail__meta"><span class="al-rail__kind">Changed</span><span class="al-tier al-tier--evidence">Evidence</span><span class="al-delta"><span class="al-delta__add">+3</span> <span class="al-delta__chg">~2</span> <span class="al-delta__del">-1</span></span></span></a></li>
          <li><a class="al-rail__link" href="#"><span class="al-rail__state al-rail__state--out"><svg class="al-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5.5"/><path d="M5.8 8h4.4"/></svg><span class="al-visually-hidden">Taken out: </span></span><span class="al-rail__name">Old runbook</span><span class="al-rail__meta"><span class="al-rail__kind">Removed</span></span></a></li>
        </ul>
        <details class="al-rail__group"><summary>Other files (2)</summary><ul class="al-rail__list" role="list"><li><a class="al-rail__link" href="#"><span class="al-rail__name al-mono">index.md</span></a></li><li><a class="al-rail__link" href="#"><span class="al-rail__name al-mono">log.md</span></a></li></ul></details>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <header class="al-reviewhead g-static-head">
      <div class="al-reviewhead__main">
        <a class="al-link-arrow al-link-arrow--back al-reviewhead__back" href="#">All proposals</a>
        <h1>Q3 board deck</h1>
        <p class="al-reviewhead__meta">1 new page, 2 changed pages · 18 facts: 12 added, 4 changed, 2 removed · Sent 3 hours ago</p>
        <p class="al-reviewhead__ref al-mono">brain/raw/q3-board-deck.pdf</p>
      </div>
      <div class="al-reviewhead__side">
        <span class="al-chip">Waiting for review</span>
        <a class="al-reviewhead__needs" href="#">1 thing still needed</a>
        <details class="al-menu al-menu--end"><summary class="al-btn al-btn--quiet">More</summary><div class="al-menu__panel al-stack al-stack--sm"><a href="#">Ask for changes</a><a href="#">Turn down</a></div></details>
        <button class="al-btn al-btn--primary" type="button">Approve all</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="al-pagesec">
      <div class="al-pagesec__head">
        <div class="al-pagesec__title"><h3>Retry budget</h3><span class="al-chip al-chip--info">Updated page</span><span class="al-delta"><span class="al-delta__add">+3</span> <span class="al-delta__chg">~2</span> <span class="al-delta__del">-1</span></span></div>
        <div class="al-pagesec__tools">
          <nav class="al-segmented" aria-label="View of this page"><a class="al-segmented__item" href="#" aria-current="true">Compare</a><a class="al-segmented__item" href="#">Whole page</a></nav>
          <button class="al-btn al-btn--sm" type="button">Accept page</button>
          <button class="al-btn al-btn--sm al-btn--danger" type="button">Take this page out</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="al-pagesec__body">
        <div class="al-compare">
          <div class="al-compare__head"><span>What gets written</span><span>Where it comes from</span></div>
          <div class="al-compare__group">
            <div class="al-compare__facts">
              <div class="al-claim al-claim--change"><div class="al-claim__op">Updated fact</div><div class="al-claim__was">Was: <del>The scheduler retries on a fixed 30-second backoff.</del></div><p class="al-claim__text">The scheduler retries on an exponential backoff starting at 30 seconds.</p></div>
              <div class="al-claim al-claim--add"><div class="al-claim__op">New fact</div><p class="al-claim__text">Jobs are retried at most five times.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="al-compare__source"><div class="al-compare__passage">
              <div class="al-source">Source: <strong>Alpha System Overview</strong>, page 3</div>
              <blockquote class="al-quote">The <mark>scheduler retries on an exponential backoff</mark> starting at <mark>30 seconds</mark>. Jobs are <mark>retried at most five times</mark> before they are parked.</blockquote>
            </div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="al-compare__group">
            <div class="al-compare__facts"><div class="al-claim al-claim--add"><div class="al-claim__op">New fact</div><p class="al-claim__text">Parked jobs are kept for a week.</p></div></div>
            <div class="al-compare__source"><div class="al-compare__passage"><div class="al-source">Source: <strong>Alpha System Overview</strong>, page 9</div><div class="al-source al-source--missing">We couldn't find that spot in the source. Check it by hand before you approve.</div></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section class="al-stack">
    <h2 class="g-h">Review: the whole page as text, folds, dialog</h2>
    <div class="al-docmeta-wrap">
      <dl class="al-dl al-docmeta"><dt>Title</dt><dd>Retry budget</dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>topic</dd><dt>Tier</dt><dd>curated</dd><dt>Sources</dt><dd><ul class="al-docmeta__sources" role="list"><li><span class="al-code">alpha-pdf</span> Alpha System Overview</li></ul></dd></dl>
      <div class="al-doc">
        <div class="al-doc__h al-doc__h--2">Retries</div>
        <p class="al-doc__p">The scheduler retries on an exponential backoff. <span class="al-cite">source: alpha-pdf, p.3</span></p>
        <div class="al-doc__li al-doc__li--0"><span class="al-doc__bullet" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span>Jobs are retried at most five times. <span class="al-cite">source: alpha-pdf, p.3</span></span></div>
        <div class="al-doc__li al-doc__li--1"><span class="al-doc__bullet" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span>A parked job is kept for a week.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
